  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734226",
      "title": "Attaching Auth Tokens to Outgoing Requests",
      "sourceHash": "8bda5eedd9a9e82c134dfe8578a1b2e05fb3f34df9cec547e784be20fa553511",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.2,
          "en": "Now, if the goal is to attach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.2,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "the token to outgoing requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 8.31,
          "en": "then of course as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.31,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "we have to store that token when we get it back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 14.67,
          "en": "from the backend after signing up or logging in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.67,
          "end": 18.78,
          "en": "Because just to bring that back in memory on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.78,
          "end": 22.71,
          "en": "for the sign up and the login routes, which I have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.71,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "even though you don't have to fully understand that code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "I am eventually creating a token and I'm returning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "that token under a token key as part of the response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 34.01,
          "en": "that's sent back to the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.01,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "So on the front end, when we get that response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 40.17,
          "en": "we now wanna extract and store that token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.17,
          "end": 41.85,
          "en": "so that as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.85,
          "end": 44.523,
          "en": "we can attach it to outgoing requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "Therefore here in my authentication file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "in the action that is triggered when we submit the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 54.27,
          "en": "before we redirect the user away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.27,
          "end": 58.2,
          "en": "we wanna extract that token from the response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.2,
          "end": 61.08,
          "en": "So here I'll get my response data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.08,
          "end": 63.483,
          "en": "by awaiting response.json.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.56,
          "end": 69.15,
          "en": "And that response data contains the token under a token key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.15,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "as you just saw in the backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 75.69,
          "en": "And that token must now be stored so that we can use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.69,
          "end": 77.91,
          "en": "The question is where do we store it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.91,
          "end": 80.01,
          "en": "And there are various options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.01,
          "end": 82.32,
          "en": "We could try to store it in memory somehow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "We could store it in a cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 86.82,
          "en": "But a very simple and straightforward option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.82,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "is to store it in local storage, which is a browser API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 93.06,
          "en": "which we can use here because you must not forget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.06,
          "end": 96.47999999999999,
          "en": "that this code and this action function runs in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 99.993,
          "en": "So we can use all standard browser features here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.37,
          "end": 104.07,
          "en": "Therefore here we can access local storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "and set a new item here to store that token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 109.74000000000001,
          "en": "in that browser storage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.74000000000001,
          "end": 113.07,
          "en": "So some storage that's managed by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 114.99000000000001,
          "en": "And I'll give it a key of token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 117.45,
          "en": "and then store my extracted token here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 118.563,
          "en": "That's what I'll do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.7,
          "end": 122.04,
          "en": "With that for the moment, that's all I wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.04,
          "end": 125.52,
          "en": "Now the token is stored here and now we can get it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 129.483,
          "en": "from local storage when we need it for outgoing requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.41,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "Now for that, I'll add a little helper function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.35,
          "en": "in a new folder called Util,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.35,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "which I create next to my Components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 142.02,
          "en": "where I'll create a file called off Auth.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.02,
          "end": 145.82999999999998,
          "en": "And in that file I'll add a function, which is exported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.82999999999998,
          "end": 147.637,
          "en": "which is called getAuthToken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "In here, I'll get my token from local storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "with help of the getItem function by using that token key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "And then I'll return that token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 160.82999999999998,
          "en": "It might look like overkill to create that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.82999999999998,
          "end": 162.99,
          "en": "for that simple code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 165.39,
          "en": "but we'll add more code to that function later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 166.99,
          "en": "That's why I'm creating it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.88,
          "end": 170.7,
          "en": "So now we have a function for extracting the token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.7,
          "end": 172.53,
          "en": "We could have also added a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.53,
          "end": 175.86,
          "en": "for writing and storing that token if we wanted to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 175.86,
          "end": 178.92000000000002,
          "en": "but here I'm fine with that extraction function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.92000000000002,
          "end": 180.75,
          "en": "And I now wanna use that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.75,
          "end": 184.62,
          "en": "in the places where I now do need a token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.62,
          "end": 188.73,
          "en": "For example, in the EventDetail JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.73,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "There we got this action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 196.41,
          "en": "where I do send that delete request in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.41,
          "end": 200.49,
          "en": "Here I'm trying to delete my event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 204.6,
          "en": "And we must add the token to this outgoing request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 206.61,
          "en": "Now, for that, we must add headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.61,
          "end": 210.03,
          "en": "and we must add the special authorization header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.03,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "and set that to a value of bearer white space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 215.4,
          "en": "and then the token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.4,
          "end": 218.25,
          "en": "That's simply the format the backend is looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.25,
          "end": 222,
          "en": "That's the header and the header format the backend expects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222,
          "end": 224.85,
          "en": "So that is something we must add like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.85,
          "end": 227.46,
          "en": "Here I then wanna add my token, but for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.46,
          "end": 230.223,
          "en": "I of course must get my token as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 234.09,
          "en": "Now thankfully, that is of course quite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.09,
          "end": 235.62,
          "en": "straightforward to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.62,
          "end": 239.82,
          "en": "We can use this new getAuthToken function which I just added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 239.82,
          "end": 243.48,
          "en": "and imported from that Util folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.48,
          "end": 245.61,
          "en": "And with it imported, we can call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.61,
          "end": 247.89,
          "en": "in this action to get our token,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.89,
          "end": 251.55,
          "en": "store it in a token constant and add that token here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.55,
          "end": 254.4,
          "en": "for this authorization header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.4,
          "end": 257.7,
          "en": "And with that, we're storing the token when we're logging in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.7,
          "end": 260.76,
          "en": "and we're then using the token for attaching it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 262.83299999999997,
          "en": "to this delete request in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 264.81,
          "end": 267.72,
          "en": "So with that added, what we can do now is again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 267.72,
          "end": 271.89,
          "en": "log in to make sure that we get a token and store it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 271.89,
          "end": 274.17,
          "en": "You can now, by the way, also see that token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.17,
          "end": 277.35,
          "en": "if you go to the application part in your dev tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.35,
          "end": 279.3,
          "en": "There you can inspect local storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.3,
          "end": 282.78,
          "en": "and you should see that your token is stored here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.78,
          "end": 285.15,
          "en": "You could also delete it here if you wanted to clear it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.15,
          "end": 286.743,
          "en": "but I'll keep it around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 287.64,
          "end": 290.55,
          "en": "And now if I go to Events and I select an event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.55,
          "end": 292.89,
          "en": "I can click Delete and confirm this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 292.89,
          "end": 295.32,
          "en": "and I successfully deleted that event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.32,
          "end": 299.79,
          "en": "I got no errors here because we did now add that token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 299.79,
          "end": 302.733,
          "en": "to the outgoing request and therefore the event is gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 303.84,
          "end": 305.58,
          "en": "So that's how we can use that token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.58,
          "end": 308.73,
          "en": "And of course we don't just wanna use it here for deleting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 308.73,
          "end": 311.1,
          "en": "but also for a couple of other requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 311.1,
          "end": 313.17,
          "en": "for example, for editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 313.17,
          "end": 316.89,
          "en": "If we edit an event then we also wanna add the token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.89,
          "end": 319.83,
          "en": "And the same is the case for adding a new event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 319.83,
          "end": 323.31,
          "en": "This action is to find here in the EventForm JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 323.31,
          "end": 325.86,
          "en": "and they offer here, I of course also wanna add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.86,
          "end": 329.67,
          "en": "my authorization header, which is set equal to bearer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 329.67,
          "end": 332.4,
          "en": "white space and then the token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 332.4,
          "end": 334.8,
          "en": "And I wanna get my token here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 334.8,
          "end": 337.47,
          "en": "with that getAuthToken helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.47,
          "end": 340.65,
          "en": "which must be imported just as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.65,
          "end": 342.933,
          "en": "So don't forget to add that import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 343.77,
          "end": 346.38,
          "en": "And with it being imported, we can call it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 346.38,
          "end": 350.31,
          "en": "we can get the token and attach it to the outgoing request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 350.31,
          "end": 351.81,
          "en": "like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 351.81,
          "end": 356.04,
          "en": "With that, we should be able to also edit and add events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 356.04,
          "end": 359.19,
          "en": "And with that, we added the token to all routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 359.19,
          "end": 361.08,
          "en": "that are protected on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 361.08,
          "end": 363.63,
          "en": "because here I am protecting my creation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 363.63,
          "end": 366.663,
          "en": "my editing and my delete routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 367.86,
          "end": 370.74,
          "en": "So therefore, now to quickly verify this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 370.74,
          "end": 375.3,
          "en": "if I try to add a new event here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 375.3,
          "end": 378.15,
          "en": "without a real image but this doesn't matter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 378.15,
          "end": 378.983,
          "en": "I can click Save.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.983,
          "end": 380.16,
          "en": "It is here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 380.16,
          "end": 383.28,
          "en": "I can also edit this, hopefully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 383.28,
          "end": 388.05,
          "en": "Yes I can and I can delete this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 388.05,
          "end": 390.063,
          "en": "That's all working as it should.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}